 nested parts, tool-call args); MATERIAL FLAW parsing tolerates
 bold/numbered/quoted lines; case-insensitive marker search on the original
 text; fan-out budget skips review term under lite and coerces strictly;
 strict self-exclusion skipped below 3 answers; per-seat call counts in
 receipts

